LUMA SUMMARY:
Long Duckspace/history session. Cozmo reconstructs an old weather/whale-song mapping experiment, insists on fresh source-grounded scans, explores weather and whale-song datasets, and riffs on forecasting, libraries, science fiction, jury service, and shared storytelling. He repeatedly tests whether the Minds remember context and jokes about human/AI roles. The session closes after a long, highly associative conversation.</summary>
